<title>UK: Abbey National sets 10 billion yen seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 10 billion yen seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.70	MATURITY    08.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.30    PAY DATE    08.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
